platform.email.invite.body:
You've been invited to join {organization} on Durby. Open this link to accept. It works once and expires in 7 days:

{link}

If you didn't expect this invitation, ignore this email.

auth.email.reset.body:
Someone asked to set a new password for your account. Open this link to choose one. It works once and expires in 30 minutes:

{link}

If this wasn't you, ignore this email; your password stays unchanged.

auth.email.verify.body:
Open this link to confirm your email address. It works once and expires in 24 hours:

{link}

If you didn't create an account, ignore this email.

staff.email.invite.body:
You have been invited to the staff portal. Set your password and two-factor authentication here (valid for 48 hours):

{link}

If you did not expect this email, ignore it.
